---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SOCIAL } from '../consts';
---

<Base title="About" description="Who I am and what this site is.">
  <article class="wrap prose">
    <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
    <p>
      Hi — I'm <strong>Your Name</strong>. I work on things at the intersection of
      software and systems, and I keep this site as a public worklog and notebook.
    </p>
    <p>
      The <a href="/log/">log</a> is short, frequent entries: what I changed,
      what broke, what I learned. The <a href="/posts/">posts</a> are longer, more
      considered write-ups. Everything is also available over
      <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Find me on <a href={SOCIAL.github}>GitHub</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
